{{> Top}}<article class="prose">
<h1>Competitors</h1>
<div class="cards">
<section class="card"><h3><span class="swatch s-go"></span>go</h3><p class="lang">Go</p><p>The standard library&rsquo;s server: a goroutine per connection on Go&rsquo;s runtime poller (epoll).</p><p><a href="https://go.dev">Go</a><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/tree/main/competitors/go">source</a></p></section>
<section class="card"><h3><span class="swatch s-axum"></span>axum</h3><p class="lang">Rust</p><p>axum 0.8 on tokio&rsquo;s multi-threaded, work-stealing runtime (epoll), TCP_NODELAY as axum&rsquo;s docs show.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum">axum</a><a href="https://tokio.rs">tokio</a><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/tree/main/competitors/axum">source</a></p></section>
<section class="card"><h3><span class="swatch s-fourneau-zig"></span>fourneau-zig</h3><p class="lang">Zig</p><p>fourneau with a Zig handler: io_uring, a fiber per connection, one shard per core sharing nothing, ReleaseSafe (assertions on).</p><p><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau">fourneau</a><a href="https://ziglang.org">Zig</a><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/tree/main/competitors/fourneau-zig">source</a></p></section>
<section class="card"><h3><span class="swatch s-roux"></span>roux</h3><p class="lang">Roc</p><p>A Roc app on roux, the Roc platform built on fourneau: the handler is Roc, compiled with the server into one static binary.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/roux">roux</a><a href="https://www.roc-lang.org">Roc</a><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/tree/main/competitors/roux">source</a></p></section>
<section class="card"><h3><span class="swatch s-basic-webserver"></span>basic-webserver</h3><p class="lang">Roc</p><p>Roc&rsquo;s own platform, as released (0.17.0): a Rust host on hyper and tokio, the handler Roc. Limits raised to the race&rsquo;s load, nothing else.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/roc-lang/basic-webserver">basic-webserver</a><a href="https://www.roc-lang.org">Roc</a><a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/tree/main/competitors/basic-webserver">source</a></p></section>
</div>
<h2>Versions</h2>
<p>Everything is pinned, and each race records what it raced. fourneau and roux are the two things that move, on purpose: a race takes the newest commit of each. How each pin is updated: <a href="https://github.com/Eldhus/fourneau-dragrace/blob/main/VERSIONS.md">VERSIONS.md</a>.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>what</th><th>pinned to</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#pins}}<tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td>{{ version }}</td></tr>
{{/pins}}</tbody>
</table>
</article>
